      "steps": [
        "形狀是 $x^ke^{-x}$，$k=2$，所以是 $\\Gamma(3)$。",
        "$\\Gamma(3)=2!=2$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$2$",
      "note": "分部積分兩次也會得到 $2$，但要寫半頁。",
      "claim": "INT(x^2*e^(-x), 0, inf) == 2"
    },
    {
      "title": "整數點的值",
      "prompt": "$\\Gamma(6)$ 與 $\\Gamma(4)$",
      "steps": [
        "$\\Gamma(n+1)=n!$，所以 $\\Gamma(6)=5!=120$。",
        "$\\Gamma(4)=3!=6$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$\\Gamma(6)=120$，$\\Gamma(4)=6$",
      "note": "不要寫成 $\\Gamma(6)=6!=720$，那是差一的錯。",
      "claim": "INT(x^5*e^(-x), 0, inf) == 120 ;; INT(x^3*e^(-x), 0, inf) == 6"
    },
    {
      "title": "指數裡有常數",
      "prompt": "$\\int_0^{\\infty}x^4e^{-3x}\\,dx$",
      "problemId": "burst-int-001",
      "steps": [
        "令 $u=3x$，$x=\\frac{u}{3}$，$dx=\\frac{du}{3}$。$x^4=\\frac{u^4}{3^4}$。",
        "積分變成 $\\frac{1}{3^5}\\int_0^{\\infty}u^4e^{-u}\\,du=\\frac{\\Gamma(5)}{3^5}$。",
        "$\\Gamma(5)=4!=24$，$3^5=243$，答案是 $\\frac{24}{243}=\\frac{8}{81}$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$\\frac{8}{81}$",
      "claim": "INT(x^4*e^(-3x), 0, inf) == 8/81"
    },
    {
      "title": "先換元才看得出來",
      "prompt": "$\\int_0^{\\infty}x^3e^{-x^2}\\,dx$",
      "problemId": "depth-int-026",
      "steps": [
        "指數是 $-x^2$，不是標準形狀。令 $u=x^2$，$du=2x\\,dx$。",
        "把 $x^3\\,dx$ 拆成 $x^2\\cdot x\\,dx=u\\cdot\\frac{du}{2}$。",
        "積分變成 $\\frac{1}{2}\\int_0^{\\infty}ue^{-u}\\,du=\\frac{1}{2}\\Gamma(2)=\\frac{1}{2}$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$\\frac{1}{2}$",
      "claim": "INT(x^3*e^(-x^2), 0, inf) == 1/2"
    }
  ],
  "pitfalls": [
    "差一：$\\Gamma(n)$ 寫成 $n!$。",
    "換元時漏了 $du$ 的係數，或 $a^{k+1}$ 寫成 $a^k$。",
    "以為 $\\Gamma(0)=0!=1$。$\\Gamma(0)$ 的積分在 $x\\to 0$ 發散，$\\Gamma$ 在 $0$ 沒有定義。"
  ],
